# Abstract

Cybercrime is increasing rapidly, and phishing remains one of the most common methods used by attackers to steal confidential information such as usernames, passwords, banking credentials, and personal data.

The **Phishing Awareness Kit** is an educational web application developed to improve users' awareness of phishing attacks. The application allows users to learn how phishing works, practice identifying phishing emails through quizzes, experience a simulated fake login page in a safe environment, and understand how to protect themselves from online scams.

The project was developed using **React.js** for the frontend and **Node.js** for the backend.

