# Chapter 7: Modules

## 1. Awareness Website

This module provides educational content explaining:

* What phishing is
* Types of phishing attacks
* Common warning signs
* Prevention techniques
* Best cybersecurity practices

---

## 2. Phishing Quiz

The quiz evaluates users' understanding of phishing.

Features:

* Multiple-choice questions
* Instant score calculation
* Performance feedback
* Awareness improvement

---

## 3. Fake Login Demo

This module demonstrates how attackers imitate genuine login pages.

Purpose:

* Educational demonstration only
* Shows why users should verify website URLs
* Teaches secure login practices

---

## 4. Email Examples

This section contains examples of:

* Genuine emails
* Phishing emails

Users learn to identify:

* Suspicious links
* Urgent language
* Fake sender addresses
* Grammar mistakes
* Unexpected attachments

